{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-file-selector#card-zh","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-file-selector","commit":"94de21e8065be479d36d2578859baf567cb414ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-selector 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的文件引用插件。它通过右侧栏标签菜单和文件树、文档预览的右键菜单，把工作区文件路径或选中的行范围追加到对话输入草稿。路径会尽量转成相对工作区的形式；预览支持单行和多行引用，也能复制路径。插件只写入引用文本，不读取文件内容，也不提交或发送草稿，适合把代码位置快速交给当前 DSH 会话讨论。安装后无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:13-21","src/client/index.ts:315-330","src/client/index.ts:840-850"]}
{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-file-selector#card-en","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-file-selector","commit":"94de21e8065be479d36d2578859baf567cb414ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-selector adds file references to the DSH web composer. Sidebar and right-click menus append a workspace path or preview line range to the draft, and users can copy paths. It writes reference text only and never submits the draft. No extra configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:13-21","src/client/index.ts:315-330","src/client/index.ts:840-850"]}
